#X obj 30 300 +~;
#X obj 30 330 outlet~;
#X text 30 380 One source at height \$1 m: direct path r1 and the path reflected by the road r2 (image source below the road). Travel time r/c gives Doppler. 1/r spreading from 1 m. car-ground = reflection coefficient (1 = hard road)., f 80;
